    metaTitle: 'Best Time to Charter a Yacht in the Mediterranean',
    metaDescription: 'Month by month, the best time to charter a yacht in the Mediterranean — weather, crowds and price across the Riviera, Italy, Corsica, Sardinia and Greece.',
